  message: "Implemented in commit c01512b82 (feat(supervisor): agent-supervisor daemon + replacement sequence). Covers: run/status/stop subcommands, decision matrix (6-row truth table), flock-based single-instance, reserved tmux prefix (hypergumbo-session-*), pane-delta signal, rate limit (8/24h default), respawn_log.log, state dir at ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/agent-supervisor/. 47 unit tests cover the full decision matrix, intent normalization, flock rejection, stop-sentinel, reserved-prefix discipline, pane-delta tracking, CLI dispatch. See CHANGELOG [Unreleased]."  # ed6f
